@startuml sequence-uc1
' System sequence diagram for UC-1. Save the render as sequence-uc1.png here.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Reader
participant "Web client" as Client
participant "API\n(conversations)" as API
participant "librarian.py" as Lib
participant "rag.search" as Search
database "SQLite\n(chunks, FTS5,\nvectors)" as DB
participant "DeepSeek API" as DS

Reader -> Client : type question, send
Client -> API : POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
API -> DB : save question
API -> Lib : generate_reply(question)
Lib -> DS : 5 descriptors for the question
alt API answers
  DS --> Lib : descriptors (JSON)
  Lib -> Search : search(question, "dense+descriptors", k=3)
else no answer in 10 s (flow 4a)
  Lib -> Search : search(question, "bm25+dense", k=3)
end
Search -> DB : BM25 / vectors / descriptor vectors
DB --> Search : scores
Search --> Lib : top 3 chunks
Lib --> API : passages (book, chapter, excerpt)
API --> Client : Server-Sent Events stream
API -> DB : save reply
Client --> Reader : three passages
Reader -> Client : select a passage
Client --> Reader : reader opens the book at the chapter
@enduml
